      "source_xml_line": 1019,
      "string_id": "bar_bar_visitors_1_start_71",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "What do you want? Don't you see, I'm trying to relax here...",
      "JA_current": "何の用だ？ 分かってないな、俺はここでリラックスしてたいんだ…。",
      "JA_new": "何の用だ？ くつろいでるのが見えないか……",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_bar_visitors_1_start",
          "phrase_id": "71",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_bar_visitors_1_start_711#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1022,
      "string_id": "bar_bar_visitors_1_start_711",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "What's new?",
      "JA_current": "何かニュースはあるかい？",
      "JA_new": "最近、何かあったか？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_bar_visitors_1_start",
          "phrase_id": "711",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_bar_visitors_1_start_7111#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1025,
      "string_id": "bar_bar_visitors_1_start_7111",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "I hear Strelok came back. He's got all the equipment you need to get to the Machine... He's hiding now though 'cause a lot of people are after him. Some are open about it while others are trying to keep their interest in him a secret. Rumor has it even Duty and Freedom have joined the hunt... Each with their own agenda.",
      "JA_current": "Strelok が戻ったと聞いた。例の「機械」にたどり着くのに必要な、すべての知識をヤツは持っている… もっとも、多くの連中がヤツを追ってるせいか、現在ヤツは隠れているけどな。ある者は公然と、他のある者は関心がない振りを装おおうとしている。噂によれば、Duty や Freedom でさえ狩りに加わったという… それぞれの目論みをもってな。",
      "JA_new": "ストレロクが戻ってきたらしい。マシンまでたどり着くのに必要な装備を持ってるそうだ……今は身を隠してるが、大勢に追われてる。堂々と追ってる連中もいれば、関心を隠してる連中もいる。デューティーやフリーダムまで捜し始めたって噂だ……それぞれ思惑があるんだろう。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_bar_visitors_1_start",
          "phrase_id": "7111",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_bar_visitors_1_start_71111#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1028,
      "string_id": "bar_bar_visitors_1_start_71111",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Looks like Strelok is right to hide.",
      "JA_current": "Strelok が隠れたのは正しい判断だろうな。",
      "JA_new": "ストレロクが隠れるのも無理はないな。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
